REM 💼 LinkedIn Network Outreach & Connection Macro
REM Title: 💼 LinkedIn Network Outreach
REM Description: Searches LinkedIn profiles by title/location keyword, inspects search results, scrolls smoothly, and captures candidate leads.
REM Tags: networking, b2b, outreach, linkedin
REM Variables: SEARCH_QUERY, OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT

VAR SEARCH_QUERY=Founder Virginia Beach
VAR OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT=linkedin_results.png

LOG Launching LinkedIn Outreach Workflow for '$SEARCH_QUERY'
NAVIGATE https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/people/?keywords=$SEARCH_QUERY
WAIT_FOR .search-results-container, div.search-results, input.search-global-typeahead__input 12000
RANDOM_DELAY 2000 3500

LOG Scrolling search results for lead evaluation
SCROLL 350
RANDOM_DELAY 1200 2200
SCROLL 350
RANDOM_DELAY 1500 2500

SCREENSHOT $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
LOG LinkedIn search results captured to $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
